#. まこっちゃん！　今日はなんの話をしよっか？
msgctxt "0001 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Hey, Mackie Chan! What should we talk about today!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まこっちゃん…ボクの事だよな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess I'm Mackie Chan now?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. どーした？　なんか話はないのん！？
msgctxt "0003 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "What's wrong!? You don't wanna talk to me!?"
msgstr ""

#. 話ならあるよ…
#. 聞きたい事があるんだ…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Actually, I did want to ask you something..."
msgstr ""

#. キミが出てきたというか…生まれたのって…
#. どうしてなの？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"When did you appear—or when were you born—or when did\n"
"you—?"
msgstr ""

#. …ん？　どーいう意味？
msgctxt "0006 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Huh? The hell are you tryin' to say!?"
msgstr ""

#. …どうして、腐川さんは
#. 二重人格になっちゃったの…？
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "How did you end up with a split personality?"
msgstr ""

#. さぁ、どうしてかしら…
#. 覚えてないわね…
msgctxt "0008 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Who knows? I don't remember the how or why of it!"
msgstr ""

#. そもそも、この世の中って、
#. そんなにドラマチックに出来てないのよ！
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Not everything's got a big dramatic backstory to it!"
msgstr ""

#. だから、偶然と言うかタイミングというか…
#. その程度の理由だったりしてね！
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Maybe it was just a coincidence or bad timing or some\n"
"other nonsense!"
msgstr ""

#. 偶然なんて…そんな理由で…
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Just coincidence? Could that really be all...?"
msgstr ""

#. 抑圧された現代社会では、
#. その反動が思わぬ型で表面化する…
msgctxt "0012 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Maybe living in a repressed modern society caused an\n"
"unexpected reaction to bubble up."
msgstr ""

#. その反動が、たまたまアタシに起きただけ！
msgctxt "0013 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "And maybe that reaction just so happened to be me!"
msgstr ""

#. 反動だから性格も正反対！
msgctxt "0014 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"And since it was a reaction to that repressed society,\n"
"my personality became the total opposite of that!"
msgstr ""

#. 一方の“あいつ”がスーパーネガティブだから…
#. もう一方の“アタシ”はスーパー…
msgctxt "0015 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"The other \"me\" is a total downer, right? So that would\n"
"make me..."
msgstr ""

#. …なんだと思う？
msgctxt "0016 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Well, what do you think? Quiz time! Hope you've been\n"
"brushing up on your Japanese!"
msgstr ""

#. ゲラゲラゲラ！
#. 唐突で無理矢理な形で入る問題萌え！！
msgctxt "0017 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Kyeeehahaha! Did the boot heel of passion just kick\n"
"down the back door to your brain!?"
msgstr ""

#. ポジティブ
msgctxt "0018 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Genki"
msgstr ""

#. アクティブ
msgctxt "0019 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Tsundere"
msgstr ""

#. アクティブ…？
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Are you...tsundere?"
msgstr ""

#. ううーん、ちょっと違うわね！
#. まあ、まこみちが言いたい事はわかるけど…
msgctxt "0021 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Bzzt! Guess again! I'd say you got the right word, but\n"
"the wrong personality!"
msgstr ""

#. アクティブは能動的…その反対はパッシブ、受動的！
#. 受け攻めってことね！
msgctxt "0022 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Tsundere is that type of person who acts all \"Blarg I\n"
"hate you!\" but they're REALLY all \"Blurf I love you!\""
msgstr ""

#. ネガティブってのは消極的！
#. その反対はァ、なんだッ！？
msgctxt "0023 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"If anything, I'm more of the yandere type. Love 'em\n"
"and cleave 'em, that's what I always say!"
msgstr ""

#. ネイティブ
msgctxt "0024 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Karaoke"
msgstr ""

#. ネイティブ…？
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Karaoke...?"
msgstr ""

#. 語感しかあってねーぞッ！
#. さては意味も知らずに答えてるな！？
msgctxt "0026 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Karaoke!? But that's—I mean—do you even get what we're\n"
"trying to do right now?"
msgstr ""

#. まこちーん？
#. 次はちゃーんと答えてねぇん？
msgctxt "0027 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "C'mon, Big Mac! Gimme a real answer here!"
msgstr ""

#. でないと…アタシと体で語り合う事に
#. なっちゃうわよぉん？
msgctxt "0028 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't want you to start dancing with the devil\n"
"just yet!"
msgstr ""

#. あらら？
#. 本当にわかんない？
msgctxt "0029 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Uh-oh! Where's that nerd-to-English dictionary when\n"
"you need it, am I right!?"
msgstr ""

#. ネガティブってのは消極的！
#. その反対はなんでしょうッ？
msgctxt "0030 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"A downer is a bummer is a total drag is a depressing\n"
"bag of crap! So what's the opposite of that?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ネガティブの反動…
#. それは…つまり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The opposite of a downer... I guess it would have to\n"
"be...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ポジティブ…
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's genki, right?"
msgstr ""

#. そう！　ネガティブの反動として、
#. ポジティブなアタシが生まれたのよ！
msgctxt "0033 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Ding ding ding! As a response to that emotional black\n"
"hole, an energetic supernova was born!"
msgstr ""

#. 堅い文学作品だけを読む“あいつ”の反動として、
#. 乙女文学しか読まない“アタシ”が生まれたの！
msgctxt "0034 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"She just wants to read her stuffy classics all day,\n"
"but give me a good erotic thriller and I'm set!"
msgstr ""

#. でもね、別にアタシらだけが特別なんじゃないの。
#. こういう反動って<CLT 3>誰にでも起こりうる事<CLT>なのよ。
msgctxt "0035 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Anyway, we're not all that special. <CLT 3>Anyone could have\n"
"that kind of weird reaction<CLT>, ya know?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、そもそも人間の存在自体が
#. 二重人格みたいなモンなんだからね！
msgctxt "0036 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I mean hell, the human mind itself is basically its\n"
"own split personality!"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんな事は…
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wait, no, that's—"
msgstr ""

#. なくないよ。じゃなきゃ、次から次に、
#. 世の中に殺人鬼が現れたりしないんだって！
msgctxt "0038 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"No, it's true! Why else would headlines be filled with\n"
"stories of murder, theft, fraud, all that crap!"
msgstr ""

#. そういう事実から目を背けて、
#. わかりやすい敵だけを槍玉にあげるなんて…
msgctxt "0039 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"To turn away from that truth is to turn the aggressor\n"
"into the victim!"
msgstr ""

#. そんな事に意味なんてねーんだよ！
#. せいぜい、テメーの渇いた良心を潤わせるだけだ！
msgctxt "0040 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"So why do it!? Embrace it, and indulge your\n"
"consciousness the way you've always wanted to!"
msgstr ""

#. いいか！　アタシだけが異常じゃねーんだ！
#. お前もアタシも同じ地平で繋がってんだよ！
msgctxt "0041 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I'm not as twisted as you might think! You and me both\n"
"gaze at the same horizon, don't we?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>滅茶苦茶だ…訳がわからない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This whole thing is a mess... It doesn't make any kind\n"
"of sense at all.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そもそも、わかろうとする事自体が
#. 無謀なんだろうけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But it's my own fault for thinking I could ever\n"
"understand...whatever this is.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 何やら、グッタリとしているようだから、
#. 最後に素敵ワードを授けよう！！
msgctxt "0044 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You seem to be totally lacking genki, so let me give\n"
"some words of wisdom to lift your spirits!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>猿も木から落ちながら、殺る！<CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"<CLT 3>Even a monkey can fall out of a tree, hit his head,\n"
"slip into a coma, and die<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラ！！
msgctxt "0046 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Kyeeehahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 23>腐川冬子（ジェノサイダー翔）の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、
#. 今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Toko's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. <CLT><CLT 3>“スキルポイント”<CLT><CLT 23>が上がりました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Your maximum number of <CLT><CLT 3>Skill Points<CLT><CLT 23> has increased!\n"
"Hey, look at you go!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ジェノサイダーと別れたボクは、
#. とりあえず自分の部屋へと戻った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After we were done, I decided to head back to my room\n"
"for a little bit...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
